@segment   balloon
@title     Projected Energy Bubble
@levels    F10
@duration  ~3m
@protected Projected Energy Bubble, PEBLE

say You've just tuned your instrument. Now you're going to put it in motion, as a Projected Energy Bubble.
pause 4
say From the top of your head, let a current begin. Down through your body, out through the soles of your feet, and back up again. A loop, always moving, always returning.
pause 6
say As it moves, it begins to spill outward. Some of it falling straight. Some spiralling clockwise. Some counterclockwise.
pause 5
say Each one sits at its own depth, its own layer, so none of them cross. But together they pull against each other, like fibres in a woven cloth. Wherever they'd meet, they form small triangles instead, pointing in, pointing out. That's what makes it strong.
hold 30
say Keep it moving. If any strand runs thin, there's always more behind it, the same rise and fall you've been breathing with the whole time.
pause 5
say Let it keep building, layer over layer, until you can no longer pick out a single strand. What's left is a bubble, and you're standing inside it.
pause 6
say This living field performs two functions.
pause 3
say First. It holds and concentrates your own energy, so you can direct it as you need.
pause 4
say Second. It protects you from outside energies, unless you consciously choose to let them in.
pause 5
say Take a moment now to feel its strength and its softness. Feel how it moves with you.
pause 10
say To recreate your PEBLE at any time. Inhale deeply, and picture the current starting again at the crown of your head.
pause 4
say Exhale, and let it fall and spiral outward the way it just did. Your bubble will form again.
pause 5
say To dissolve it, inhale, and draw the current back up into your crown, letting the strands unwind as they go.
pause 6
